$var wire 1 h rst_n $end
$var wire 1 i clear $end
$var wire 1 j bit_valid $end
$var wire 1 k bit_in $end
$var wire 1 l flush $end
$var reg 1 m byte_valid $end
$var reg 8 n byte_out [7:0] $end
$var reg 3 o bit_count [2:0] $end
$var reg 8 p byte_buf [7:0] $end
$upscope $end


$scope module u_encoding_wrapper $end
